# {{projectName}} — AI Agent Context

## What this repository is

`{{projectSlug}}` is the **KORAS Control Plane** — the platform provisioning and
entitlement authority for all KORAS SaaS products. Generated from
`koras-saas-starter` using `--profile control-plane`.

## Critical rules

- This is NOT a normal SaaS product. Do not add tenant tables or billing flows.
- Product registration endpoints live here; the Control Plane never registers itself.
- The Control Plane must bootstrap without requiring a pre-existing Control Plane.

## Key commands

```bash
make bootstrap   # first-time setup
make dev         # start local stack
make down        # stop containers
make test        # run all tests
make health      # verify all services
```

## Technology stack

- **Frontend:** Next.js 15, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui
- **Backend:** FastAPI, Python 3.12+, SQLAlchemy 2, ARQ
- **Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL) with RLS
- **Auth:** ZITADEL (KORAS staff identity — MFA enforced)
- **Secrets:** Doppler

## Environment model

| Environment | Branch    |
|-------------|-----------|
| `dev`       | `develop` |
| `test`      | `test`    |
| `stg`       | `staging` |
| `prod`      | `main`    |

## Platform capabilities

- Product registry — register and manage KORAS products
- Organization registry — manage customer organizations
- Tenant registry — manage tenants across products
- Provisioning authority — orchestrate product infrastructure
- Reconciliation engine — drift detection and correction
- Subscription management — plan and billing lifecycle
- Entitlement authority — feature gate decisions
- Infrastructure registry — track all provisioned resources

